  "textDump": "“\nThe details are not the details. They make the design.”\n— Charles Eames\n\nThese guidelines are meant to help you create things that live in the Dropbox ecosystem and express our brand in the best way possible. But they’re just the beginning. What’s next is up to you.\n\nAll of this information is a toolkit. Go use it to make things. Really cool, well-designed things. Then share them with us, and the world. We can’t wait to see them.\n\nBrand Partner Toolkit\nLegal Branding Resources\nDropbox Brand Studio\n🤝\nDaybreak Studio\nFramework\nVoice & Tone\nLogo\nTypography\nIconography\nColor\nImagery\nMotion\nAt Dropbox, our Brand Guidelines help us infuse everything we make with identity.\nFrom icons to illustration, logos to language, this collection is the foundation for how Dropbox looks, feels, and sounds like Dropbox.\nPartner Info"
